<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14283" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dis-pālor</span></b> , ātus,
		1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. dep.
				n., to wander about, to straggle, stray</i> (very rare).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: dispalati ab
			signis, Sisenn. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 101, 6</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. ib. 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Nep. Lys. 1,
			2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Hann. 5, 2</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Amm. 15, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">31,
			2</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">multitudo in varias artes dispalata,</span>”
				<i>scattered, dispersed</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pseudo Sall. de Rep. Ord. 2, 5</span></i>
			. </div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
